\toc3 Colophon
\m This book was designed by Basil Crow.
\m It was edited and set into type in California.
\b
\m The text face is Valkyrie, designed by Matthew Butterick
\m as a hybrid of Aldus and Trump Mediaeval.
\b
\m The Greek text is set in GFS Heraklit, designed by Hermann Zapf
\m and digitized by Daniel Benjamin Miller.
\b
\m Glory be to God for all things. Amen. Amen. Amen.
